## 🧠 State Management — Use BLoC (You Already Chose Right)

> **Recommendation: `flutter_bloc` ✅ — Best for this scale**

### Why BLoC over others for YOUR app:

| Criteria | BLoC | Riverpod | GetX |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Scalability** | ✅ Excellent | ✅ Good | ⚠️ Gets messy at scale |
| **Streaming (SSE/AI responses)** | ✅ Native with StreamSubscription | ✅ Good | ⚠️ Manual |
| **Testability** | ✅ Best-in-class | ✅ Good | ❌ Hard |
| **Team/Enterprise standard** | ✅ Industry standard | ✅ Growing | ❌ Non-standard |
| **Multi-model parallel state** | ✅ Multiple BLoCs easily | ✅ | ⚠️ |

### BLoC Pattern for AI Chat (Streaming)

```dart
// ChatEvent
abstract class ChatEvent {}
class SendMessage extends ChatEvent { final String prompt; final String modelId; }
class StreamChunkReceived extends ChatEvent { final String chunk; }
class StreamCompleted extends ChatEvent {}

// ChatState
abstract class ChatState {}
class ChatIdle extends ChatState {}
class ChatStreaming extends ChatState { final String partialResponse; }
class ChatDone extends ChatState { final String fullResponse; }
class ChatError extends ChatState { final String message; }
```

