## 🔥 Key Architecture Decisions

### 1. AI Streaming (SSE) Pattern
```
UI (ChatPage) → ChatBloc → ChatRepository → ChatRemoteDataSource
                                              ↓
                                    StreamController<String>
                                    (chunks arrive in real-time)
```

### 2. Multi-Model Compare Architecture
```
CompareBloc manages a List<ModelResponseState>
One StreamSubscription per model running in parallel
Each chunk update triggers emit() with updated list
```

### 3. Token Wallet — Global Access
```dart
// In injection.dart — register as singleton
getIt.registerSingleton<WalletBloc>(WalletBloc());

// Access from any screen via BlocProvider.value()
// Deduct tokens after every AI response
```

### 4. Clean Architecture Flow (per feature)
```
Presentation (BLoC) 
    → Domain (UseCase → Repository interface)
        → Data (Repository impl → DataSource → API/DB)
```

